[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Percy Buttons]
[00:07.83]Who is Percy Buttons? | 谁是珀西·巴顿斯？
[00:13.48]I have just moved to a house in Bridge Street. | 我刚搬到桥街的一所房子里。
[00:18.43]Yesterday a beggar knocked at my door. | 昨天一个乞丐敲我的门。
[00:21.94]He asked me for a meal and a glass of beer. | 他向我要一顿饭和一杯啤酒。
[00:26.16]In return for this, | 作为回报，
[00:28.19]the beggar stood on his head and sang songs. | 乞丐倒立着唱歌。
[00:32.52]I gave him a meal. | 我给了他一顿饭。
[00:34.75]He ate the food and drank the beer. | 他吃了食物，喝了啤酒。
[00:38.11]Then he put a piece of cheese in his pocket and went away. | 然后他把一块奶酪放进口袋里，走了。
[00:42.74]Later a neighbour told me about him. | 后来一位邻居告诉我关于他的事。
[00:46.24]Everybody knows him. | 每个人都认识他。
[00:48.36]His name is Percy Buttons. | 他的名字叫珀西·巴顿斯。
[00:51.10]He calls at every house in the street once a month | 他每个月到街上的每家每户拜访一次
[00:55.22]and always asks for a meal and a glass of beer. | 并且总是要求一顿饭和一杯啤酒。